WEBVTT

00:00:04.690 --> 00:00:07.020
<i>This is the Mortal Census Bureau.</i>

00:00:07.460 --> 00:00:11.480
<i>It's the afterlife department that 
manages human lifespan records.</i>

00:00:12.590 --> 00:00:17.990
<i>This room here is not a 
laundromat by any stretch.</i>

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:21.410
<i>It's the spirit cleansing room.</i>

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:34.400
Nasty

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:34.400
Cleaning

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:34.400
Not-nasty

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:34.400
Rebirth

00:00:22.690 --> 00:00:27.040
<i>Spirits that have turned evil in 
the living world are brought here</i>

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:29.650
<i>to be cleansed on their 
way to their next lives.</i>

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:33.360
<i>This is one of the tasks of 
the Mortal Census Bureau.</i>

00:00:46.840 --> 00:00:51.220
I will have my revenge.

00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:57.800
That was from the spirit cleansing room.

00:00:59.030 --> 00:01:01.970
Conserve Water

00:01:05.610 --> 00:01:06.590
What happened?

00:01:07.570 --> 00:01:09.670
It... It got away.

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:56.030
Fox Trap

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:57.310
So in other words,

00:02:57.310 --> 00:03:01.160
that spirit got away in the middle of 
cleaning, and now you can't find it?

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:02.820
Yeah, that's right.

00:03:02.820 --> 00:03:04.960
Another scandal?

00:03:04.960 --> 00:03:07.910
You lost bonus money last time, didn't you?

00:03:07.910 --> 00:03:09.240
Shut up.

00:03:09.240 --> 00:03:11.450
I came all this way just to let you know.

00:03:11.450 --> 00:03:13.780
You don't even offer tea?

00:03:13.780 --> 00:03:15.270
It's not even my house.

00:03:16.560 --> 00:03:17.920
Dude.

00:03:21.160 --> 00:03:24.930
What's the deal with you two, 
coming into my house unannounced?

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:26.350
Are you all right?

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:27.520
Go home!

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:32.550
Tsubasa-kun.

00:03:33.240 --> 00:03:34.940
Coming.

00:03:40.030 --> 00:03:41.810
Do you know where the salt is?

00:03:43.270 --> 00:03:44.090
Here.

00:03:44.090 --> 00:03:45.220
Thanks.

00:03:51.680 --> 00:03:55.810
<i>Mamiya-san's making me rice porridge.</i>

00:03:55.810 --> 00:03:57.410
<i>Just for me.</i>

00:04:00.180 --> 00:04:02.880
No, thank <i>you</i>.

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:08.330
Thanks for coming here, really.

00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:17.230
You guys!

00:04:24.980 --> 00:04:26.910
Your porridge's ready.

00:04:29.320 --> 00:04:31.430
Take your medicine after you eat, okay?

00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:34.040
Thanks.

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:36.810
It must be tough living alone.

00:04:36.810 --> 00:04:40.890
<i>Jumonji comes from a long line of exorcists.</i>

00:04:40.890 --> 00:04:45.680
<i>His parents are both traveling 
the nation exorcising spirits.</i>

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:51.040
<i>What the hell is going on, anyway?</i>

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:54.440
<i>Mamiya-san's here, and they're ruining it.</i>

00:04:55.350 --> 00:04:56.460
Mamiya-san...

00:04:57.970 --> 00:04:59.490
What's wrong?

00:04:59.490 --> 00:05:01.290
I caught a cold.

00:05:01.290 --> 00:05:03.510
My parents are both away.

00:05:03.510 --> 00:05:05.360
Hack, hack, cough.

00:05:06.100 --> 00:05:07.170
Oh, no.

00:05:07.170 --> 00:05:08.320
I'll be right there.

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:11.580
<i>Does that mean...</i>

00:05:14.400 --> 00:05:16.910
It's just the two of us, Mamiya-san.

00:05:16.910 --> 00:05:19.490
It's just the two of us, Tsubasa-kun.

00:05:22.660 --> 00:05:23.460
Here.

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:25.280
Say "ah."

00:05:25.280 --> 00:05:27.940
<i>That's how it was supposed to go!</i>

00:05:29.270 --> 00:05:30.260
You going to eat?

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:31.850
Go home, Rokudou!

00:05:31.850 --> 00:05:35.040
Rokudou-kun came out of concern, too.

00:05:35.040 --> 00:05:37.400
Yup, yup, totally concerned.

00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:39.830
You totally aren't.

00:05:39.830 --> 00:05:41.800
You're here to get in my way, aren't you?

00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:43.670
Mamiya-san told you she was coming, didn't she?

00:05:43.670 --> 00:05:45.030
Come on, eat already.

00:05:45.550 --> 00:05:47.110
Hot! Hot!

00:05:47.980 --> 00:05:49.110
Hot!

00:05:49.520 --> 00:05:51.660
Do you not even serve snacks here?

00:05:52.710 --> 00:05:55.790
What I <i>really</i> want to 
know is why you're here.

00:05:56.570 --> 00:05:58.670
Read this, Rokudou Rinne.

00:06:02.050 --> 00:06:03.050
Don't eat that!

00:06:03.290 --> 00:06:06.050
It's a document regarding the escaped spirit.

00:06:07.030 --> 00:06:08.380
Why me?

00:06:08.590 --> 00:06:12.760
Because there's a possibility that 
it'll show up in your vicinity.

00:06:20.620 --> 00:06:22.780
<i>A hundred years ago.</i>

00:06:22.780 --> 00:06:26.280
<i>A nine-tailed fox was 
causing a panic in town.</i>

00:06:26.280 --> 00:06:27.910
A nine-tailed fox?

00:06:29.090 --> 00:06:32.980
<i>The nine-tailed fox was a fox which, after 
having lived for a long time, turned evil.</i>

00:06:32.980 --> 00:06:38.380
<i>It was adept at sorcery, deceiving people 
and creating trouble all the time.</i>

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:48.070
Spirit cleansing room, 100 years ago

00:06:39.980 --> 00:06:44.220
<i>It was Tamako the Shinigami 
who hunted it down and sent it</i>

00:06:44.220 --> 00:06:46.940
<i>to the spirit cleansing room 
at the Mortal Census Bureau.</i>

00:06:48.290 --> 00:06:52.350
Rub-a-dub-dub, five times four is twenty.

00:06:52.350 --> 00:06:56.310
Rub-a-dub-dub, five times eight is forty.

00:06:57.410 --> 00:06:59.370
Damn you, Tamako.

00:06:59.370 --> 00:07:05.070
I shall see to it that your progeny 
are cursed a hundred years hence.

00:07:05.540 --> 00:07:07.610
Tamako the Shinigami?

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:10.070
That's your grandma, Rokudou-kun.

00:07:11.040 --> 00:07:18.220
<i>The fox's grudge was deep. Try as they 
might, no one could cleanse the spirit.</i>

00:07:18.390 --> 00:07:24.330
Spirit cleansing room, 60 years ago

00:07:24.550 --> 00:07:26.860
Damn you!

00:07:26.860 --> 00:07:32.340
Spirit cleansing room, 40 years ago

00:07:34.910 --> 00:07:40.350
Spirit cleansing room, 20 years ago

00:07:35.920 --> 00:07:41.210
<i>With advances in cleaning technology, 
its sorcery powers were reduced somewhat,</i>

00:07:41.210 --> 00:07:44.490
<i>but the fox's spirit has 
yet to be cleansed fully.</i>

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:50.370
Damn you, I'll make sure you're cursed.

00:07:55.140 --> 00:07:59.120
It's been exactly a hundred years since 
the nine-tailed fox was captured.

00:07:59.570 --> 00:08:01.540
Progeny? Does that mean...

00:08:02.020 --> 00:08:03.960
It's going to curse Rokudou-kun?

00:08:04.310 --> 00:08:06.070
Yeah, I believe so.

00:08:06.700 --> 00:08:10.110
That's why, Rokudou Rinne, 
as much as I don't want to,

00:08:10.110 --> 00:08:12.530
I've decided to keep an 
eye on your surroundings.

00:08:13.470 --> 00:08:17.250
But I'm only here to capture the fox.

00:08:17.250 --> 00:08:18.970
I'm not here to protect you.

00:08:21.110 --> 00:08:22.040
He's gone.

00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:22.980
He left.

00:08:23.350 --> 00:08:26.100
He said he's going to go talk to Tamako-sama.

00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:28.630
It's getting late.

00:08:28.630 --> 00:08:30.610
I should go home too, Tsubasa-kun.

00:08:31.960 --> 00:08:34.110
I'll walk you home, Mamiya-san.

00:08:34.110 --> 00:08:36.050
You have to get some rest.

00:08:40.560 --> 00:08:43.100
Eat the porridge and warm up and get some sleep.

00:08:43.100 --> 00:08:43.950
See you.

00:08:43.950 --> 00:08:44.930
Thanks for having us.

00:08:44.930 --> 00:08:46.140
Take care.

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:56.930
What the hell was that?

00:08:58.150 --> 00:09:02.020
I hardly got a chance 
to talk with Mamiya-san.

00:09:03.190 --> 00:09:03.930
But...

00:09:04.930 --> 00:09:08.940
I have Mamiya-san's hand-made porridge!

00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:12.450
Haurgh!

00:09:13.520 --> 00:09:15.430
Rokudou! You...

00:09:15.430 --> 00:09:17.070
Thank you for the food-con.

00:09:17.380 --> 00:09:20.030
You're getting it today!

00:09:20.250 --> 00:09:21.990
Holy Ash!

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:24.470
Damn you!

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:37.140
Cough, cough.

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:50.730
Sakura-chan.

00:09:51.290 --> 00:09:52.400
Morning.

00:09:52.400 --> 00:09:54.110
How did it go yesterday, Sakura-chan?

00:09:55.160 --> 00:09:56.390
How was what?

00:09:56.390 --> 00:09:59.250
You went to check up on 
Jumonji-kun yesterday, right?

00:09:59.250 --> 00:10:00.820
I heard his parents weren't home.

00:10:00.820 --> 00:10:03.050
It was just you two? No way.

00:10:03.050 --> 00:10:06.120
Nah, Rokudou-kun was there, too.

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:08.330
What? Come on.

00:10:14.700 --> 00:10:16.980
Morning, Tsubasa-kun.

00:10:16.980 --> 00:10:18.550
I heard you were sick.

00:10:18.550 --> 00:10:20.290
I'm all better now-con.

00:10:20.860 --> 00:10:22.390
Are you really?

00:10:22.390 --> 00:10:23.670
Con-con.

00:10:23.670 --> 00:10:25.240
You're still coughing.

00:10:30.950 --> 00:10:32.150
I missed.

00:10:33.410 --> 00:10:34.680
Lightning!

00:10:34.680 --> 00:10:35.990
I'm scared!

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:39.660
<i>Most people can't see Kain the Shirushigami.</i>

00:10:39.660 --> 00:10:42.370
Nine-tailed fox, come out in peace.

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:44.030
What are you talking about-con?

00:10:44.030 --> 00:10:48.300
As a spirit, you need a body in 
order to carry out your revenge.

00:10:48.300 --> 00:10:49.830
You possessed Jumonji, didn't you?

00:10:50.260 --> 00:10:52.080
It took over his body?

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:53.880
Hurry up and come out.

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:55.340
Or else...

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:56.840
Wait, Kain.

00:10:56.840 --> 00:10:59.350
Don't hurt Tsubasa-kun's body, okay?

00:11:01.120 --> 00:11:02.870
I'm so happy, Mamiya-san.

00:11:02.870 --> 00:11:05.060
You're worried for me, aren't you?

00:11:05.510 --> 00:11:06.520
<i>Huh?</i>

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:08.060
<i>He's not saying "con."</i>

00:11:08.570 --> 00:11:09.360
Dude.

00:11:11.220 --> 00:11:12.810
What was that for-con?

00:11:12.810 --> 00:11:14.420
It's back again.

00:11:14.420 --> 00:11:17.010
Looks like you haven't 
possessed him completely yet.

00:11:17.010 --> 00:11:19.070
What do you mean, Rokudou-kun?

00:11:19.420 --> 00:11:26.240
Right now, Jumonji's mind and the 
nine-tailed fox are fighting over his body.

00:11:27.030 --> 00:11:31.250
It's because the fox has lost some of 
its power due to the spirit cleansings.

00:11:31.660 --> 00:11:34.880
I asked Grandma about the fox.

00:11:36.270 --> 00:11:42.380
Resting Place

00:11:37.840 --> 00:11:40.490
The nine-tailed fox, huh?

00:11:44.970 --> 00:11:48.130
It's not even that powerful 
a fox to begin with.

00:11:48.730 --> 00:11:51.210
I'm sure it wanted to curse my progeny

00:11:51.210 --> 00:11:55.290
because it knew it would lose 
again if it fought me straight up.

00:11:56.760 --> 00:11:58.320
It's a wimp, huh?

00:11:58.320 --> 00:12:00.630
So how do we get rid of it?

00:12:00.630 --> 00:12:02.250
She didn't tell me.

00:12:02.970 --> 00:12:03.910
Why not?

00:12:07.130 --> 00:12:11.240
But if it was a hundred years 
ago when you caught the fox,

00:12:11.240 --> 00:12:12.710
how old does that make you, Grandma?

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:16.710
Oh, dear. I don't remember anymore.

00:12:17.490 --> 00:12:18.640
Go away!

00:12:18.640 --> 00:12:20.550
Kablooey!

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:22.630
So that was that.

00:12:22.630 --> 00:12:24.450
So she wouldn't tell you.

00:12:25.560 --> 00:12:29.790
In any case, we have to do something before 
Jumonji becomes completely possessed.

00:12:29.790 --> 00:12:30.430
Con.

00:12:30.740 --> 00:12:33.130
If we're kicking it out, it's now or never!

00:12:33.690 --> 00:12:35.860
Anti-magic mirror, con!

00:12:40.280 --> 00:12:42.440
It deflected Kain's attack.

00:12:42.750 --> 00:12:44.130
Quit resisting!

00:12:44.510 --> 00:12:45.280
Con.

00:12:48.970 --> 00:12:51.120
He caught the Shinigami 
scythe with his bible.

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:54.010
Shinigami begone-con!

00:12:58.830 --> 00:13:02.360
This body's got a lot of tricks-con.

00:13:02.360 --> 00:13:03.960
Lucky-con.

00:13:06.860 --> 00:13:09.490
For someone with such a 
stupid speech habit...

00:13:09.490 --> 00:13:10.600
He's strong.

00:13:22.850 --> 00:13:24.890
What's Jumonji up to?

00:13:24.890 --> 00:13:27.740
He seems to be flailing 
around all by himself.

00:13:27.740 --> 00:13:30.100
I hope he's okay.

00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:31.750
I bet he still has a fever.

00:13:31.750 --> 00:13:33.450
He was still coughing, too.

00:13:33.450 --> 00:13:35.860
<i>Ordinary people can't see Rokudou Rinne</i>

00:13:35.860 --> 00:13:38.730
<i>while he's wearing his 
Haori of the Underworld.</i>

00:13:38.730 --> 00:13:40.900
You're not getting away 
with this, nine-tailed fox.

00:13:40.900 --> 00:13:43.090
Jumonji did nothing to get caught up in this.

00:13:43.590 --> 00:13:45.420
I'll hunt you down now.

00:13:46.550 --> 00:13:48.930
Try it if you can-con.

00:13:49.850 --> 00:13:52.720
Holy Ash doesn't work on me!

00:13:52.720 --> 00:13:54.770
Holy Ash-con!

00:13:57.500 --> 00:13:58.460
What the?

00:13:59.570 --> 00:14:00.810
<i>I can't breathe.</i>

00:14:01.330 --> 00:14:02.920
The Holy Ash is in a ball!

00:14:02.920 --> 00:14:04.650
It's different from his usual attacks.

00:14:04.970 --> 00:14:06.950
Fox Fire-con!

00:14:10.180 --> 00:14:11.660
Rokudou-kun!

00:14:17.570 --> 00:14:18.580
He's gone.

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:20.720
R-Rinne-sama...

00:14:20.720 --> 00:14:21.590
It can't be!

00:14:24.230 --> 00:14:26.590
You ran off into the Reidou, con?

00:14:31.140 --> 00:14:33.430
It deflected the Shinigami Scythe.

00:14:43.620 --> 00:14:45.690
He defended himself with a magic barrier.

00:14:45.690 --> 00:14:48.730
I can read you like a book-con.

00:14:51.510 --> 00:14:52.690
I see.

00:14:52.690 --> 00:14:55.080
He still has all of Jumonji's memories.

00:15:04.620 --> 00:15:05.640
Kain.

00:15:05.640 --> 00:15:06.710
You're alive?

00:15:07.160 --> 00:15:12.160
Looks like the synergy of your powers has 
made you stronger than I thought you'd be.

00:15:13.610 --> 00:15:15.100
Cough, cough.

00:15:15.340 --> 00:15:16.360
In which case,

00:15:16.360 --> 00:15:19.600
it's more effective to flush out the 
fox spirit with Separation Incense.

00:15:19.640 --> 00:15:29.860
Separation Incense

00:15:20.170 --> 00:15:21.490
<i>Allow me to explain.</i>

00:15:21.490 --> 00:15:22.810
<i>Separation Incense is</i>

00:15:22.810 --> 00:15:26.760
<i>a Shinigami tool that drives spirits 
from the bodies they're possessing.</i>

00:15:26.760 --> 00:15:29.860
<i>An affordable 20 yen per can.</i>

00:15:30.420 --> 00:15:34.370
<i>Note that it doesn't work on cockroaches.</i>

00:15:37.720 --> 00:15:39.830
Cough, cough.

00:15:42.070 --> 00:15:43.000
It's out!

00:15:44.450 --> 00:15:46.390
Spirit Lasso!

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:50.650
Good, that's it.

00:15:50.650 --> 00:15:52.550
Pull it up and finish the job.

00:15:53.750 --> 00:15:54.510
What?

00:15:54.510 --> 00:15:55.800
Gonk!

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:57.180
Transformation technique?!

00:15:57.180 --> 00:15:59.180
It's a fox spirit power.

00:15:59.470 --> 00:16:01.310
Serves you right-con.

00:16:01.590 --> 00:16:02.730
What?

00:16:02.730 --> 00:16:04.480
Separation Incense doesn't work on it?

00:16:06.710 --> 00:16:08.230
Power stone.

00:16:08.230 --> 00:16:10.420
Come forth, sprites.

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:16.980
You call these sprites?

00:16:28.640 --> 00:16:29.500
I hate you!

00:16:30.520 --> 00:16:31.760
Kapapapow!

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:32.970
Bop, bop, bop!

00:16:36.810 --> 00:16:40.620
<i>The sprites of Jumonji's power 
stone are pretty powerful.</i>

00:16:40.620 --> 00:16:41.960
<i>On top of that, looking the way they do,</i>

00:16:41.960 --> 00:16:47.020
<i>they inflict emotional damage and a 
sense of exasperation along with physical pain.</i>

00:16:48.350 --> 00:16:50.780
That gets rid of that nuisance.

00:16:51.020 --> 00:16:53.930
<i>But the fox spirit's half out.</i>

00:16:54.390 --> 00:16:56.280
Wake up, Tsubasa-kun.

00:16:56.280 --> 00:16:58.120
Don't let that fox beat you.

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:04.380
Forgive me, Mamiya-san.

00:17:04.380 --> 00:17:07.380
I can't control myself, the fox has me.

00:17:07.380 --> 00:17:08.190
Con.

00:17:08.190 --> 00:17:11.920
Hang in there just a little. 
You'll be back to your normal self.

00:17:19.480 --> 00:17:20.230
Snip.

00:17:21.990 --> 00:17:24.230
Jumonji, you...

00:17:24.530 --> 00:17:28.990
You're getting back at me and 
blaming it on the fox, aren't you?

00:17:28.990 --> 00:17:29.960
Don't be silly.

00:17:29.960 --> 00:17:30.610
Con.

00:17:34.900 --> 00:17:36.200
There's no end to this.

00:17:48.170 --> 00:17:49.980
The sprites are down!

00:17:50.850 --> 00:17:52.670
Damn you!

00:17:53.770 --> 00:17:58.090
I'll drag the fox spirit 
out by force if I have to!

00:18:03.980 --> 00:18:05.020
Just a little more!

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:06.310
Come on!

00:18:07.810 --> 00:18:09.160
Prepare yourself.

00:18:13.720 --> 00:18:14.520
What?

00:18:19.270 --> 00:18:21.200
It's the clone technique this time.

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:23.450
It's another fox sorcery power.

00:18:27.960 --> 00:18:29.050
Shoot.

00:18:30.790 --> 00:18:31.420
Stop!

00:18:42.500 --> 00:18:43.220
What?

00:18:44.460 --> 00:18:46.850
Rokudou Rinne, prepare yourself.

00:19:12.940 --> 00:19:16.130
There's no way to tell 
which one's the real one.

00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:17.330
Pow!

00:19:23.630 --> 00:19:24.760
It's you!

00:19:27.280 --> 00:19:28.770
Chain of Anti-magic!

00:19:33.090 --> 00:19:35.930
Tsubasa-kun's got Rokudou-kun 
on the defensive.

00:19:35.930 --> 00:19:37.530
W-Wow.

00:19:40.750 --> 00:19:42.310
Did you see that, Mamiya-san?

00:19:42.310 --> 00:19:44.200
This is my true ability.

00:19:44.200 --> 00:19:45.270
Huh?

00:19:45.270 --> 00:19:46.780
He stopped saying con again.

00:19:49.170 --> 00:19:53.070
Hey, Jumonji. You're totally 
conscious, aren't you?

00:19:53.480 --> 00:19:54.290
Con?

00:19:56.200 --> 00:19:57.780
See that, Mamiya-san?

00:19:57.780 --> 00:20:02.050
I'm a lot more awesome than Rokudou!

00:20:02.760 --> 00:20:05.760
There, there, there!

00:20:06.260 --> 00:20:09.770
<i>I'm pretty sure it's Tsubasa-kun 
talking right now.</i>

00:20:10.510 --> 00:20:13.080
I swear, you're conscious right now!

00:20:20.020 --> 00:20:20.790
Conk!

00:20:22.030 --> 00:20:24.550
A washtub just fell out of the Reidou.

00:20:24.550 --> 00:20:25.870
Why a washtub?

00:20:37.410 --> 00:20:39.130
Now, Rokudou Rinne!

00:20:39.130 --> 00:20:41.260
Drag the fox out and put it in the washtub!

00:20:41.470 --> 00:20:42.490
Got it.

00:20:43.590 --> 00:20:47.620
Scuttle, scuttle, scuttle!

00:20:44.680 --> 00:20:45.470
Hey!

00:20:45.710 --> 00:20:49.610
That idiot Jumonji, he's stealing the fox!

00:20:49.610 --> 00:20:50.930
It must have grown on him.

00:20:51.860 --> 00:20:53.060
I have no choice.

00:20:56.690 --> 00:20:58.400
Oh, shoot!

00:21:04.730 --> 00:21:06.110
You did it!

00:21:09.330 --> 00:21:11.240
They're getting sucked in.

00:21:13.850 --> 00:21:17.130
<i>It turns out that this isn't 
just an ordinary washbasin.</i>

00:21:18.090 --> 00:21:24.410
<i>It's connected directly to the spirit 
cleansing room at the Mortal Census Bureau.</i>

00:21:32.500 --> 00:21:34.640
<i>And a few hours later...</i>

00:21:42.440 --> 00:21:43.650
It's done.

00:21:49.720 --> 00:21:52.000
Good. Cleansing's complete.

00:21:53.770 --> 00:21:59.520
<i>And so the spirit of the nine-tailed 
fox made it safely to the Rinne no Wa.</i>

00:22:01.210 --> 00:22:02.460
<i>And as for Tsubasa-kun,</i>

00:22:04.440 --> 00:22:09.780
<i>he came home all clean, 
having been rid of the fox.</i>

00:22:09.780 --> 00:22:11.970
Are you all right now, Jumonji?

00:22:11.970 --> 00:22:13.860
You were at the nurse's office, huh?

00:22:13.860 --> 00:22:15.980
Your skin's kind of shiny.

00:22:16.260 --> 00:22:18.260
Welcome back, Tsubasa-kun.

00:22:18.260 --> 00:22:22.450
Man, that sucked, being controlled like that.

00:22:22.450 --> 00:22:24.880
You're insisting that it 
was all the fox's fault?

00:22:24.880 --> 00:22:28.010
It looks like your soul 
isn't entirely clean yet.

00:22:29.080 --> 00:22:29.980
<i>Teehee!</i>

00:24:01.040 --> 00:24:25.980
Next Episode:
Spirited Ramen

00:24:02.020 --> 00:24:05.420
<i>Ramen: popular and affordable.</i>

00:24:05.420 --> 00:24:07.800
<i>Despite tending to be classified 
as sub-gourmet food,</i>

00:24:08.190 --> 00:24:14.380
<i>boom after boom has evolved it into the 
people's soul food that it is today.</i>

00:24:14.790 --> 00:24:18.660
<i>We investigate the secrets of the artisans 
that brought it to its glory today.</i>

00:24:19.100 --> 00:24:22.870
<i>Next time on <i>Rin-ne</i>:
"Spirited Ramen."</i>

00:24:22.870 --> 00:24:25.980
<i>A passionate tale of passionate men.</i>
